    "title": "Air defenses shoot down another seven drones flying toward Moscow",
    "text": "MOSCOW, June 18. /TASS/. Air defenses have downed another seven drones flying toward Moscow, Mayor Sergey Sobyanin said.\n\"Seven more drones heading for Moscow have been shot down. Emergency personnel are working at the sites where debris came down,\" he wrote on Russia’s national messenger Max.\nEarlier, Sobyanian said that the Defense Ministry’s air defenses had destroyed 15 drones flying toward the capital.",
